<html>
    <head>
        <style>
            body {
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
                color: #333;
            }
            .otp {
                font-size: 28px;
                font-weight: bold;
                letter-spacing: 4px;
                color: #1a73e8;
            }
            .note {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #777;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <h4>Dear {{name}},</h4>
        <p>We received a request to reset the password for your <b>TMS</b> account.</p>
        <p>Your One-Time Password (OTP) to verify your identity is:</p>
        <p class="otp">{{otp}}</p>
        <p class="note">This OTP is valid for 10 minutes. If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email.</p>
        <p>Regards,<br />VolksEnergie TMS Team</p>
    </body>
</html>
